    <string name="settings_wear_section">Wear OS capture</string>
    <string name="settings_wear_explain_button">How this works</string>
    <string name="settings_wear_section_hint">When you speak an entry on the watch, it uploads straight to the cloud in the background — no need for the watch and phone to be near each other or on the same Wi-Fi. This phone then transcribes and parses whatever\'s pending automatically, both when you open it and periodically in the background. Some phones (especially OnePlus/Oppo, Xiaomi, Vivo, Huawei) restrict background apps by default, which can delay that background processing — if entries from your watch seem to be taking a while to show up, allow background activity for Contempo below, and also check your phone\'s Battery/Phone Manager app for a separate "Auto-launch" or "Startup manager" toggle — some phones gate background delivery behind that too, and it isn\'t reachable from here.</string>
